#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&krita; is part of the &koffice; package. &krita; is a photo retouching, "
#| "image editing application, but above all, a paint application that will "
#| "allow you to create original art on your computer as if you were working "
#| "with paint and brushes, pencils, pen and ink &mdash; or, at least, it "
#| "will one day. We are continually working on extending &krita; and making "
#| "it better in every respect."
msgid ""
"&krita; is part of the &koffice; package. &krita; is a photo retouching, "
"image editing application, but above all, a paint application that will "
"allow you to create original art on your computer as if you were working "
"with paint and brushes, pencils, pen and ink &mdash; or, at least, it will "
"one day. We are continually working on extending &krita; and making it "
"better in every respect. Please consider helping out with code, "
"documentation or work on our website!"
msgstr ""
"&krita; ជា​ផ្នែក​មួយរបស់​​កញ្ចប់ &koffice; ។ &krita; ជា​កម្មវិធី​សម្រាប់​កែកុន​រូបថត និង​ជា​កម្មវិធី​"
"សម្រាប់​កែសម្រួល​រូបភាព  ប៉ុន្តែ​កម្មវិធី​ទាំងអស់​ដែល​បាន​រៀបរាប់​ខាងលើ​អាច​ឲ្យអ្នក​បង្កើតសិល្បៈ​ដើម​នៅ​លើ​"
"កុំព្យូទ័រ​របស់​អ្នក​ ហើយ​អ្នក​ពុំ​ចាំបាច់​ធ្វើ​ការ​ជាមួយ ច្រាស ខ្មៅដៃ ប៉ិច និង​ទឹក​ខ្មៅ &mdash; ។ យើ​ង​កំពុង​ធ្វើ​"
"ការ​ពង្រីកសមត្ថភាព &krita; និង​បង្កើត​វា​ឲ្យ​កាន់​តែ​ប្រសើរ​ជាមុន ។"

